      <title>Anthropic IPO is About Capital, Says Kathryn Thompson</title>
      <link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-19/anthropic-ipo-is-about-capital-says-kathryn-thompson-video</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">b9f0054a75e73ca331bff0e1</guid>
      <pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 22:17:51 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>Anthropic’s long-awaited debut marks the first ever by a frontier AI lab, a cohort of firms building the most advanced models to tackle difficult problems and assist users in complex tasks. While enthusiasm over AI’s business potential have spurred massive investments in infrastructure such as chips and data centers, Anthropic and its competitors now need to grow revenue fast enough to outpace those ambitious spending plans. Kathryn Thompson, CEO, Thompson Research Group, says that much of the AI play is about access to capital, but the biggest change for data centers is the political landscape. (Source: Bloomberg)</description>
